Web Awesome (@awesome.me/webawesome)
https://webawesome.com

Kigumi generates framework wrappers around Web Awesome's web components. The
generated wrappers carry API documentation (property, event, slot, and method
descriptions) derived from Web Awesome's custom elements manifest.

