Web Awesome Pro

Web Awesome Pro is commercial software requiring a paid license from Fonticons,
Inc. Kigumi does not bundle, redistribute, or include any Web Awesome Pro code,
type definitions, or documentation.

Kigumi supports Pro components by rewriting import paths at install time for
projects that already hold a Pro license. Artifacts derived from the Pro package
(type-check shims and Pro component metadata) are generated locally by license
